@ResearchPulse1 @Chocolatechil20 You are missing the molecular forest for the trees. Let’s do the math on your 25mg pill.

A 25mg daily oral dose equals 175mg of peptide API per week. The maximum injectable Wegovy dose is 2.4mg per week.

